#. おやおやおやおやおやおやおやぁッ！！
msgctxt "0001 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Hey hey hey hey hey hey HEY!"
msgstr ""

#. 霧切さんはいいとしても…だ。
msgctxt "0002 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Kyoko I don't mind so much."
msgstr ""

#. なんで処刑されたはずの苗木クンが
#. 一緒にいるんだよッ！？
msgctxt "0003 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"But Makoto's supposed to be dead! What's HE doing\n"
"here!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>思った通りの反応…だけど……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's exactly how I thought he'd react...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>本当に…大丈夫なのか…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Are we really gonna be okay...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. もしかして霧切さんが助けちゃったの！？
#. せっかく、おしおきしたのにっ！？
msgctxt "0006 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "You were supposed to be punished! Did Kyoko help you!?"
msgstr ""

#. …だったら、どうするの？
msgctxt "0007 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "So what if I did? What will you do?"
msgstr ""

#. 学級裁判で正しいクロを指摘した場合は、
#. クロだけがおしおき…
msgctxt "0008 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"If the guilty party is exposed during the class trial,\n"
"they alone will be executed."
msgstr ""

#. 哀しいけど…これって校則なのよね。
msgctxt "0009 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "It's unfortunate, but that *is* the rule..."
msgstr ""

#. だから、もう１度おしおきだよ！
#. 今度こそ間違いなく、おしおきだよ！！
msgctxt "0010 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"So now I gotta punish you again! And this time I won't\n"
"leave anything to chance!"
msgstr ""

#. き、霧切さん…！
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "K-Kyoko...!"
msgstr ""

#. …好きにしたらいいんじゃない。
msgctxt "0012 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Do whatever you feel you have to."
msgstr ""

#. えぇっ！？
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr ""

#. だけど、その前に、
#. １つだけ言っておくわ…
msgctxt "0014 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "But before you do, let me just say one thing."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君を処刑すれば、
#. あなたの負けって事になるけど…構わないのね？
msgctxt "0015 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"If you execute Makoto, that means you lose. Not that\n"
"that matters to you, right?"
msgstr ""

#. は？
msgctxt "0016 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. ボクの…負けって…
msgctxt "0017 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "I...lose?"
msgstr ""

#. おいッ！　どういう意味だよ！？
msgctxt "0018 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "You! Explain yourself! What do you mean by that!?"
msgstr ""

#. そもそも、あの学級裁判は
#. あなたが仕組んだものなんでしょう？
msgctxt "0019 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Well you set up this latest class trial yourself,\n"
"right?"
msgstr ""

#. ジャマな私をあぶり出して殺す為にね…
msgctxt "0020 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I was getting in your way, so you wanted an excuse to\n"
"kill me."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、本来であれば、
#. あの学級裁判で処刑されるのは私だったはず…
msgctxt "0021 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I was supposed to be chosen as the blackened and then\n"
"executed, right?"
msgstr ""

#. ちょ、ちょっと…何を言ってんだよ……
msgctxt "0022 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "H-Hey, what are you talking about?"
msgstr ""

#. だけど、その思惑は見事に外れた。
#. 苗木君が私の矛盾を見逃してくれたお陰でね。
msgctxt "0023 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But when Makoto chose to overlook my lie, your plan\n"
"came crashing down."
msgstr ""

#. その結末は、あなたにとっては予想外だったはずよ…
msgctxt "0024 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The results of the trial weren't at all what you were\n"
"expecting."
msgstr ""

#. あの場面で他人をかばう人がいるなんて、
#. あなたには想像も付かなかったでしょうから…
msgctxt "0025 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Because you never imagined that in that position, one\n"
"person would protect another like that."
msgstr ""

#. そして、その予想外の展開を受け、
#. あなたが出した答えは…
msgctxt "0026 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "And in response to that unexpected development..."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君をクロとして処刑する事。
msgctxt "0027 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"...you reacted by proclaiming *Makoto* the blackened\n"
"and trying to execute *him*."
msgstr ""

#. 苦し紛れの選択…
#. いえ、それだけじゃないわね…
msgctxt "0028 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"You made the choice out of desperation. No, more than\n"
"that..."
msgstr ""

#. あなたは苗木君を脅威に感じていたはずよ。
#. 思惑通りに動かない苗木君をね…
msgctxt "0029 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"You must have realized that Makoto, who refused to be\n"
"manipulated, was a threat to you, as well."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0030 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. だけど、そこでも予想外の展開が、
#. あなたを待ち受けていた…
msgctxt "0031 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But then there was *another* unexpected development\n"
"waiting for you."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君の処刑をジャマしようとする存在…
msgctxt "0032 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"An entity that would throw a wrench, so to speak, in\n"
"your precious execution machinery."
msgstr ""

#. アルターエゴ…
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Alter Ego..."
msgstr ""

#. あなたにとっては誤算だったわね。
#. 死んでもなお、誰かを助ける存在があるなんて…
msgctxt "0034 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"You never imagined the possibility of a being that\n"
"could come to our aid even after you'd \"killed\" it."
msgstr ""

#. …これが真実よ。
msgctxt "0035 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Now, here's the absolute truth."
msgstr ""

#. 戦刃むくろを殺したのは、
#. 苗木君じゃなくて、あなただったのよ。
msgctxt "0036 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Makoto didn't kill Mukuro. You did."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0037 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. それにも関わらず、苗木君を処刑するなんて、
#. あなたの大嫌いな校則違反にあたるはずよ。
msgctxt "0038 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"So executing Makoto for it would surely be a violation\n"
"of your rules, which I know you love so much."
msgstr ""

#. だって、クロが処刑されるのは、
#. クロを正しく指摘出来た場合のみ…そう言ったわよね？
msgctxt "0039 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"If the blackened is exposed, they alone will be\n"
"executed. That's what you told us, right?"
msgstr ""

#. ふーん…
#. だから、ボクの負け…？
msgctxt "0040 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Hmph. And that means I lose?"
msgstr ""

#. 言ってくれるじゃん。
#. 本当のクロは、苗木クンじゃなくてボクだって？
msgctxt "0041 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"You talk a big game. You're saying the blackened is me\n"
"and not Makoto?"
msgstr ""

#. …で、その根拠は？
msgctxt "0042 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "And you can prove this, right?"
msgstr ""

#. ないわよ。根拠なんて。
msgctxt "0043 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "No, I can't."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そ、そんなにハッキリと…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Don't just say it like that!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …ふざけてるの？
#. そこまで言い切っておいて根拠がないなんてさぁ…
msgctxt "0045 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"What is this, a comedy routine? To make such bold\n"
"claims without a shred of evidence..."
msgstr ""

#. 今はないってだけよ。
#. もう少し時間があれば、すぐに見つけられるわ。
msgctxt "0046 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I don't have any right now, but with a little more\n"
"time I guarantee I'll find some."
msgstr ""

#. どんなに隠そうとも、
#. 真実はいつも１つなんだから…
msgctxt "0047 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Because no matter how deeply you try to bury it, there\n"
"is only ever one absolute truth."
msgstr ""

#. なんだよ…
#. どっかの名探偵みたいなセリフ吐いちゃってさ…
msgctxt "0048 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"And now you're trying to talk like some kind of famous\n"
"detective type?"
msgstr ""

#. もし、苗木君が犯人だったら、
#. わざわざ、あなたの前に現れたりしないわ…
msgctxt "0049 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"If Makoto really was the killer, he never would have\n"
"come to you willingly like this."
msgstr ""

#. 人を殺した罪に怯え…処刑される罰に怯え…
#. もっと悲惨に逃げ回っているはずよ…
msgctxt "0050 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"He would have feared for his life, feared another\n"
"execution. He would have tried to run and hide."
msgstr ""

#. あなたの好きな絶望に蝕まれながらね…
msgctxt "0051 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"He would have been gripped by the despair you so love\n"
"to inspire."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、私達はここにいる。
#. 希望を失わずにあなたに立ち向かっている。
msgctxt "0052 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But here we are—confronting you with nothing but hope\n"
"in our hearts."
msgstr ""

#. それが根拠の代わり…とでも言うつもり？
#. そんな事で、ボクが納得すると思ってんの？
msgctxt "0053 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"And that's supposed to be enough to convince me in the\n"
"absence of evidence?"
msgstr ""

#. 確かに、あなたは納得しないでしょうね。
#. だけど…
msgctxt "0054 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "It's not you I'm trying to convince."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>“これ”を見てる人達<CLT>だって同じよ。
#. このまま苗木君を処刑しても納得しないはず…
msgctxt "0055 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"If you were to execute Makoto now, <CLT 3>everyone out there\n"
"watching this<CLT> would be extremely displeased."
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. このまま苗木君を処刑したところで、
#. これを見てる人達から、こう思われるだけよ…
msgctxt "0057 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Imagine what everyone out there would think if you\n"
"killed Makoto..."
msgstr ""

#. 私達の言葉が図星だったからこそ、
#. あなたは彼の処刑を強行したんだって…
msgctxt "0058 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"They would assume that you killed him because what we\n"
"said is exactly right."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>“絶望”<CLT>では<CLT 3>“希望”<CLT>を殺せないんだって…
msgctxt "0059 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "<CLT 3>Despair<CLT> can never kill <CLT 3>hope<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. ぐ…！
msgctxt "0060 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Grh—!"
msgstr ""

#. ただの言いがかりだと言うなら、
#. それを証明して見せればいいじゃない？
msgctxt "0061 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Of course, you can say we're just making this all up.\n"
"You're welcome to prove us wrong."
msgstr ""

#. いえ、証明して見せるしかないはずよ…
msgctxt "0062 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "No, you have no choice *but* to prove it."
msgstr ""

#. 無実を証明しないまま苗木君を殺せば、
#. あなたは、自分の負けを認めた事になるんだから…
msgctxt "0063 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Because if you kill Makoto without proving your own\n"
"innocence, you'll be accepting your own defeat."
msgstr ""

#. ぐぐぐ…ッ！！
msgctxt "0064 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Gh-grg-grah!"
msgstr ""

#. あなたが“正々堂々と”私達を絶望させたいなら、
#. 私の“提案”を受けるべきなのよ。
msgctxt "0065 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "If you want to earn our despair \"fair and square\"..."
msgstr ""

#. そうするべきなのよ…
msgctxt "0066 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "...then I suggest you take my advice."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0067 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. それで、なんなのさ…
#. その提案って…？
msgctxt "0068 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "So? What is this \"advice\" of yours?"
msgstr ""

#. もう１度、戦刃むくろ殺しの学級裁判を、
#. やり直すのよ。
msgctxt "0069 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "To do Mukuro's trial over again."
msgstr ""

#. 今度こそ、校則に基づいた公平な裁判をね…
msgctxt "0070 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Only this time, you follow the school regulations to\n"
"ensure a fair trial."
msgstr ""

#. そこで最後の勝負をしましょう。
#. <CLT 3>“希望”<CLT>と<CLT 3>“絶望”<CLT>を賭けた最後の勝負よ！
msgctxt "0071 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"It's time for one last showdown—one final battle\n"
"between <CLT 3>hope<CLT>...and <CLT 3>despair<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. …どう？　クライマックスに相応しい展開じゃない？
msgctxt "0072 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Well? That would make for a proper climax, wouldn't\n"
"you say?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>公平な裁判…最後の勝負……
#. つまり…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A fair trial...one last showdown... In other words...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>戦刃むくろを殺した黒幕…
#. その正体を明らかにする裁判！？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This would be our chance to expose the true identity\n"
"of Mukuro's killer—of the mastermind themselves!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど、そんな勝負…
#. 黒幕にとっては受ける理由なんてないんだし…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But...what reason would the mastermind have to accept\n"
"the challenge?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>きっと問答無用で、ボクを処刑に…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0076 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They'll probably just execute me without another\n"
"word...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0077 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ………………
msgctxt "0078 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. クックックック…面白いよ…
msgctxt "0079 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Kehehe... Interesting."
msgstr ""

#. 面白いクマ！
msgctxt "0080 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Beary interesting indeed!"
msgstr ""

#. …クマ？
msgctxt "0081 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Beary?"
msgstr ""

#. キャラチェンジしてみたクマ。
#. そろそろ飽きてきたんで。
msgctxt "0082 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Oh, I was getting bored, so I decided to change things\n"
"up a little. So, time for bear jokes!"
msgstr ""

#. まぁ、そういう展開もありかもしれないクマ。
#. 確かに、クライマックスに相応しいクマ。
msgctxt "0083 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Now, what you've suggested might be pawsible. It would\n"
"certainly make for one honey of a climax!"
msgstr ""

#. …受けるって事？
msgctxt "0084 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Does that mean you accept?"
msgstr ""

#. そうすれば、キミタチも視聴者も納得なんでしょ？
msgctxt "0085 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"If we do things your way, that'll be enough to\n"
"convince you *and* the viewers, right?"
msgstr ""

#. 納得した上で、絶望してくれるんでしょ？
msgctxt "0086 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "And it would cause you unbearable despair, right?"
msgstr ""

#. だったら、やってやるクマ！
msgctxt "0087 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Then I'm prebeared to agree to your terms!"
msgstr ""

#. キミタチの“希望”が勝つか…
#. ボクの“絶望”が勝つか…
msgctxt "0088 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Will your hope win out? Or will my desbear claim\n"
"victory...?"
msgstr ""

#. 最後の勝負をするクマー！！
msgctxt "0089 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Let's have one final grizzly showdown!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>最後の勝負って事は…じゃあ！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0090 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He agreed...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…まだチャンスがあるって事か！？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0091 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Then we still have a shot at this...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. だけど、せっかくのクライマックスなんだし、
#. 単に犯人を当てるだけじゃ盛り上がらないクマ？
msgctxt "0092 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"But this is the long-awaited climax, right? Just\n"
"guessing the killer is bearly a fitting end."
msgstr ""

#. だから、最終対決にふさわしく、
#. キミタチには、すべての謎を解いてもらおうかなー！
msgctxt "0093 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"So for this final face-off, you'll have to unearth all\n"
"the mysteries that have been bearied here!"
msgstr ""

#. すべての…謎…？
msgctxt "0094 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "All the mysteries...?"
msgstr ""

#. この学園に潜むすべての謎だよ。
#. それを解き明かす事が出来たら…
msgctxt "0095 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"That's right. Every last mystery that's pawing around\n"
"the school. If you can do that..."
msgstr ""

#. キミタチの勝ちって事にしてやるクマよ！
msgctxt "0096 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"...then that'll be enough to koalafy as a victory for\n"
"you!"
msgstr ""

#. こっちだって…最初からその気よ…
msgctxt "0097 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That's what we've been trying to do all along..."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、決定クマ！！
msgctxt "0098 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Okay, well, good! Then let's bear it all!"
msgstr ""

#. 戦刃むくろを殺した犯人と、その犯行を突き止め、
#. なおかつ、学園の謎を解き明かす事が出来たら…
msgctxt "0099 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"If you can claw your way to the truth of Mukuro's\n"
"death, AND solve the mysteries of this school..."
msgstr ""

#. キミタチ全員の勝利を認めましょう！
msgctxt "0100 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "...then you win!"
msgstr ""

#. ただし、それが出来なかった時は…
msgctxt "0101 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "But if you *can't* do all of that..."
msgstr ""

#. 私達全員が処刑…ね？
msgctxt "0102 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "We'll all face execution. Right?"
msgstr ""

#. クックック…楽しみクマ…
msgctxt "0103 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Kehehe... I can bearly contain my excitement..."
msgstr ""

#. すべてを知った時…
#. キミタチはどんな絶望を見せてくれるのかな？
msgctxt "0104 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"When you learn the whole truth...what kind of despair\n"
"will you show me?"
msgstr ""

#. 楽しみなのはこっちよ…
msgctxt "0105 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "We're as excited as you are, I'm sure."
msgstr ""

#. すべてを解き明かされた時、
#. 超高校級の絶望は、どんな風に絶望するのかしら？
msgctxt "0106 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"When we've uncovered every last truth, how will the\n"
"Ultimate Despair reveal their own despair...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>な、なんだか…
#. すごい展開になってきたな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0107 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I honestly can't believe how this has all turned\n"
"out...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. だけど、その前に…
#. １つだけハッキリさせておきたいんだけど…
msgctxt "0108 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But before we get started, I want to clarify one more\n"
"thing."
msgstr ""

#. 前に、あなたは言っていたわよね？
msgctxt "0109 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Do you remember the rule?"
msgstr ""

#. 学級裁判は、生徒同士の間で殺人が起きた場合に、
#. 行われるものだって…
msgctxt "0110 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"When one student kills another, that's when a class\n"
"trial is held."
msgstr ""

#. それが、どうかしたクマ？
msgctxt "0111 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "I remember that, fur sure. So what?"
msgstr ""

#. 確認しておきたいの。
#. その言葉に間違いはないわね？
msgctxt "0112 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I just want to confirm, that *is* what you said,\n"
"right? And it's a true statement?"
msgstr ""

#. クックック…そんな風に探らなくたって、
#. 教えてやるクマよ…
msgctxt "0113 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Kehehe. You don't have to be so suspicious. I've said\n"
"it before, but it bears repeating..."
msgstr ""

#. すべては…校則に基づいて起きた事クマ……
msgctxt "0114 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Everything is based on the school regulations."
msgstr ""

#. もちろん、戦刃むくろの学級裁判が開かれた事も、
#. 例外じゃないクマよ…
msgctxt "0115 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "And having a trial for Mukuro is no exception to that."
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0116 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>戦刃むくろの学級裁判も例外じゃない…？
#. 校則に基づいて起きた事…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0117 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Mukuro's trial is no exception? Then...it's part of\n"
"the regulations?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>じゃあ、戦刃むくろを殺した犯人って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0118 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Which would have to mean that whoever killed Mukuro...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. クックック…
#. むしろ、ついでにヒントをもう１つやるクマ…
msgctxt "0119 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Kehehe... It's a very polarizing approach, I know,\n"
"but—okay, enough puns. Anyway, here's a hint..."
msgstr ""

#. 確か、前にも言ったと思うクマ…
msgctxt "0120 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "I'm sure I told you this already, but..."
msgstr ""

#. この<CLT 3>“コロシアイ学園生活”<CLT>の参加者は、
#. 全部で１６人の高校生だけだって…
msgctxt "0121 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"...this <CLT 3>killing game<CLT> began with sixteen\n"
"participants, all of them high school students."
msgstr ""

#. ちなみに、コロシアイ学園生活が始まった後、
#. 希望ヶ峰学園に生きたまま足を踏み入れた人間も…
msgctxt "0122 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"And the only people to take a single step in Hope's\n"
"Peak since the killing game began..."
msgstr ""

#. その１６人だけだったクマ。
msgctxt "0123 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "...are those sixteen students."
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0124 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

#. それって…本当なの…？
msgctxt "0125 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Are you telling the truth?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0126 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ………………
msgctxt "0127 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. なんだよ…急に黙り込んで…
msgctxt "0128 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Why'd he go quiet all of a sudden...?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0129 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. うぷ…うぷぷぷ…
msgctxt "0130 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Puhu... Puhuhu..."
msgstr ""

#. 話はもう終わりだよ！
#. オマエラに言う事なんて、何１つ残ってないよ！！
msgctxt "0131 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "I'm done talking! I got nothin' left to say to you!"
msgstr ""

#. だから出てけーーーっ！！
msgctxt "0132 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "So get lost, would ya!?"
msgstr ""

#. …急に怒った！？
msgctxt "0133 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Why so mad!?"
msgstr ""

#. 情緒不安定なのかしら…？
msgctxt "0134 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "He seems...emotionally unstable."
msgstr ""

#. いいから、さっさと行けっての！！
msgctxt "0135 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Leave me alone! Get outta here!"
msgstr ""

#. も、もちろん行くさ。
#. 行くけど…
msgctxt "0136 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "O-Okay, I'm going. I just..."
msgstr ""

#. 本当に…行っていいんだな…？
msgctxt "0137 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You're really gonna let me go?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0138 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ふん…別にいいもんね…
msgctxt "0139 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Hmph. I don't even care anymore."
msgstr ""

#. どうせ…後でみんなまとめて、
#. おしおきなんだし…
msgctxt "0140 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "You're all gonna get your punishment later anyway."
msgstr ""

#. …オマエラの為に用意しておくよ。
#. とってもスペシャルで絶望的な、おしおきをさ…
msgctxt "0141 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"I need to start getting it ready. A super duper extra\n"
"special punishment, overflowing with despair..."
msgstr ""

#. うぷ…うぷぷぷぷ…
msgctxt "0142 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Puhu... Puhuhu..."
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷ…
msgctxt "0143 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Puhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhu..."
msgstr ""

#. …行きましょう、苗木君。
msgctxt "0144 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Come on, Makoto. Let's go."
msgstr ""

#. うん…
msgctxt "0145 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷぷぷうぷぷぷぷうぷぷぷぷうぷぷぷぷうぷぷぷぷ
#. うぷぷぷぷうぷぷぷぷうぷぷぷぷうぷぷぷぷうぷぷぷぷ
msgctxt "0146 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Puhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhu\n"
"huhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhuhu..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>不安定気味なモノクマの
#. 不気味な笑い声を背に受けながら…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0147 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Monokuma's unstable laughter seemed to cling to us as\n"
"we walked away.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボク達は体育館を後にした…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0148 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And just like that, we were out of the gym.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
